        "description": "<ul>\n<li>You need to be a Hillebrand Gori client in order to use this plugin.</li>\n<li>This plugin works with WooCommerce. It allows the users to select Hillebrand Gori eShipping shipping options in their orders.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Please visit https://eshipping.hillebrandgori.com to learn more.</p>\n<p>Sources available at https://github.com/HillebrandGoriEshipping/HillebrandGoriEshippin-wc</p>\n"
